msgid "microSD card"
msgstr "microSD kartica"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m4.rst:211
msgid ""
"When a card is inserted it is mounted automatically at ``/sdcard`` and is "
"usable through the regular file system::"
msgstr ""
"Kada je kartica umetnuta, automatski se montira na ``/sdcard`` i može se "
"koristiti kroz uobičajeni datotečni sustav::"

