"mogu koristiti za korisnički PWM bez ometanja kamere."

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-m4.rst:379
msgid ""
"**TIM4 is shared with** :ref:`pyb.Servo <pyb.Servo>` — instantiating a servo"
" reconfigures the whole timer for 50 Hz operation, so don't mix "
":ref:`machine.PWM <machine.PWM>` on P7/P8 with :ref:`pyb.Servo <pyb.Servo>` "
"in the same script."
msgstr ""
"**TIM4 se dijeli s** :ref:`pyb.Servo <pyb.Servo>` — instanciranje servo "
"motora ponovno konfigurira cijeli mjerač vremena za rad na 50 Hz, pa nemojte"
" miješati :ref:`machine.PWM <machine.PWM>` na P7/P8 s :ref:`pyb.Servo "
"<pyb.Servo>` u istoj skripti."

